	"descriptionMarkdown": "## 🪐 Slice-based Gleba Blueprint Book 🍓\n\nMy approach for a loop-based Gleba factory setup !\n\n### Usage\n\nI recommend separating your setup into **two distinct loops** (or sushi belts), along with **additional considerations**:\n- The **first loop** should be dedicated to **fruit processing** (Yumako/Jellynut), as well as **spoilage-based nutrients**\n- The **second loop** should contain the **rest of the slices**\n- Each slice has a **spoilage output belt** that should be routed to the Power Plant's **heating towers**\n\n### Features\n- Copper/Iron Bacteria slices\n- Yumako & Jellynut processing slices\n- 3 nutrient slices: Spoilage/Yumako Mash/Bioflux\n- Bioflux slice\n- Biosulfur/Bioplastic/Bio-Rocket Fuel/Biolubricant slices\n- Carbon Fiber slice\n- Extra Power Plant setup if you don't have one already",
